# Normain App — Permissions Catalog

> Permissions in the Normain app, mapped to roles. Feeds the roles/permissions section of the KPMG deliverable.
>
> **Scoped-variant note:** some team-level permissions (e.g. "Remove member from team") may split into "any team" vs "only teams the actor belongs to" — mirroring "Add member to team" vs "…team I'm a part of". Confirm whether that split is a general pattern.

